{
  "//": "web-skills.json — OPTIONAL manifest for .claude/scripts/bootstrap-web.sh.",
  "//comment": [
    "DO NOT hand-curate a fixed list here. The cc-web-setup skill GENERATES this file",
    "from the SAME per-repo selection the user confirms during setup (the marketplace-",
    "scout agent discovers candidates from the repo's stack; the user picks). The two",
    "entries below are ILLUSTRATIVE shape only — your real entries come from your picks.",
    "",
    "Each entry is a skill that bootstrap-web.sh fetches FRESH each cloud session,",
    "over HTTPS (no git), into ~/.claude/skills/<leaf>/, then asks Claude Code to",
    "re-scan (reloadSkills) so it is available THIS session, first prompt. This is",
    "the DYNAMIC alternative to vendoring: skills here are NOT committed, so they",
    "track upstream automatically — at the cost of a per-session HTTPS fetch.",
    "",
    "Prefer VENDORING (commit the skill into the repo's own .claude/skills/<leaf>/)",
    "for anything that must be available with zero network — it carries over as part",
    "of the clone and needs neither this hook nor reloadSkills. Use this manifest for",
    "the rest. Rename to web-skills.json (drop .example) and commit it to enable.",
    "",
    "SKILLS ONLY. AGENTS and slash-COMMANDS cannot be surfaced this way (reloadSkills",
    "re-scans skill/command dirs but not agents, and these land in ~/.claude/skills/).",
    "Vendor agents into .claude/agents/ and commands into .claude/commands/ instead.",
    "",
    "Fields per entry:",
    "  repo  owner/repo of the GitHub source (public, or private with GH_TOKEN set)",
    "  ref   git ref to fetch — PIN AN IMMUTABLE COMMIT SHA for reproducibility. An",
    "        empty string tracks the moving default branch (logged as a warning).",
    "  path  path to the skill dir INSIDE that repo (the dir holding SKILL.md)",
    "  leaf  directory name to install under ~/.claude/skills/; rewritten into the",
    "        copied SKILL.md's frontmatter name so it drives the /<leaf> command id"
  ],
  "skills": [
    {
      "repo": "anthropics/claude-plugins-official",
      "ref": "0000000000000000000000000000000000000000",
      "path": "plugins/superpowers/skills/brainstorming",
      "leaf": "brainstorming"
    },
    {
      "repo": "nq-rdl/agent-extensions",
      "ref": "v0.15.0",
      "path": "skills/go-naming",
      "leaf": "go-naming"
    }
  ]
}
